        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woolly can be played in the background while you do other things. Wait for your sheep to grow then gather their fleeces to earn money. Occasionally tend to your sheep, cleaning up after them and feeding them treats to help them grow faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688970/extras/324edaa439e447379cfd61567216e122.poster.avif?t=1779900334\" width=898 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688970/extras/324edaa439e447379cfd61567216e122.webm?t=1779900334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688970/extras/324edaa439e447379cfd61567216e122.mp4?t=1779900334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all sheep are the same! Their fleeces are random - discover each colour and pattern to complete your collection and find out which ones generate the most income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688970/extras/2533aa2bda8fff5453c0d3d6d8f97acd.poster.avif?t=1779900334\" width=898 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688970/extras/2533aa2bda8fff5453c0d3d6d8f97acd.webm?t=1779900334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688970/extras/2533aa2bda8fff5453c0d3d6d8f97acd.mp4?t=1779900334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle game for running in the background while you work or relax.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse-only controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ fleece patterns to find and collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock breeding to discover even more fleeces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades to help automate tasks.</p></li></ul>",
